            "width": 672,
            "height": 224,
            "content": "## ⚠️ Timing assumptions\n\n1. **Reload App** polls once a minute, so this flow takes a few minutes.\n2. **Cancel Reload** cancels a reload started a moment earlier with Make API Call. An empty app reloads in seconds; if the reload already finished, Qlik answers 409 and Cancel Reload fails. Keep Cancel Reload directly after the Make API Call.\n3. **Reload Finished** registers a user-level webhook at flow start; the Wait lets the subscription settle before the first reload. Webhook deliveries can take a few minutes."
